# Keep the build context (and image) lean. The app needs only source, the small versioned
# order DB (data/db/orders.json) and the demo case file (data/datasets). Everything heavy, raw,
# or training-only is excluded here.
.git
.github
venv
.venv-train
**/__pycache__
*.log
study
models
data/raw
data/pools
data/cache
data/eval
data/outbox
.env
